OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry start with a few
OL,6,Fsunny intervals then cloud increasing
OL,7,Fto bring a few showers from late
OL,8,Fmorning. Showers fading later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon with some sunny intervals
OL,10,Freturning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with some bright
OL,13,Fspells at first. Clouding over later
OL,14,Fin the evening and overnight with some
OL,15,Fshowers, staying drier in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FRather cloudy start with a few
OL,18,Flight showers. Dry and cool the rest
OL,19,Fof the day with some bright or sunny
OL,20,Fspells and variable cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
