OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fand brighter with some sunny spells on
OL,7,FSaturday. Bright start Sunday then
OL,8,Fcloudier with a few afternoon showers.
OL,9,FDry with bright or sunny spells on
OL,10,FMonday.
